8. CHEMISTRY AND SAFETY DISCLAIMER

ChemPath is an educational reaction-network and graph-algorithm project.
It is not a laboratory synthesis planner, medical tool, safety system, or
professional chemical engineering service.

Reaction paths, graph weights, conditions, and related outputs must not be
treated as instructions for performing chemical reactions. Users are
responsible for consulting qualified professionals, authoritative sources,
and applicable laboratory safety procedures before conducting any chemical
work.

